# scripts/watch-convergence.sh --self-test, green, and the three ways it was made to fail.
# Taken in the chat session's own sandbox (Ubuntu, python 3.11.15, curl), NOT on the devbox.
# The instrument has no verdict over the repository, so it is not a gate and owes no break
# test. It owes trust, which is a different thing: the self-test asks it a question whose
# answer is known, and these breaks show the self-test can say no.

